+# TalkWagon SEO Batch 04 Image Notes
+
+## Decision
+
+Batch 04 did not generate new competitor-page imagery because the only
+authoritative V2.2 competitor page is the already-published `/wati-alternative`
+page, and that page already has three page-specific, optimized, non-branded
+visual placements from the approved Batch 03 visual expansion.
+
+This avoids unnecessary asset churn and keeps the page visually compliant:
+
+- no competitor logo or interface;
+- no fake comparison score;
+- no fake price or statistic;
+- no “winner” badge or superiority symbol;
+- no readable generated text;
+- no customer data, people, faces, or private UI.
+
+## Final Batch 04 visual placements
+
+| Placement | File | Dimensions | Size | Use |
+| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | --- |
+| Hero / OG / Twitter | `public/hostiko-crm/generated/commercial/talk-wagon-wati-alternative-evaluation-v2.webp` | 1168 × 880 | 73,008 bytes | Neutral alternative-evaluation hero |
+| Supporting visual 1 | `public/hostiko-crm/generated/commercial/talk-wagon-wati-workflow-evaluation-v2.webp` | 1168 × 880 | 79,766 bytes | Workflow evaluation view |
+| Supporting visual 2 | `public/hostiko-crm/generated/commercial/talk-wagon-wati-decision-framework-v2.webp` | 1168 × 880 | 83,646 bytes | Buyer decision framework |
+
+## Source generation workflow
+
+- Generator: installed `higgsfield-generate` workflow
+- Model used for the WATI visual set: Nano Banana Pro
+- Source style: TalkWagon forest-green SaaS dashboard illustration
+- Final delivery format: WebP
+- Final dimensions: 1168 × 880
+- Optimization target: below 250 KB per image
+
+The original Batch 03 image prompt record is preserved in:
+
+`docs/seo/implementation/batch-03-image-prompts.md`
+
